The table of numerals leaves out CM, so 1994 comes out as MDCDXCIV.

--- c/roman.c
-    {900, "CM"},
--- cpp/roman.cpp
-    {900, "CM"},
--- rust/src/lib.rs
-    (900, "CM"),
--- go/roman.go
-	{900, "CM"},
--- python/roman.py
-    (900, "CM"),
--- javascript/roman.js
-  [900, "CM"],
--- typescript/roman.ts
-  [900, "CM"],
--- dart/lib/roman.dart
-  (900, 'CM'),
--- kotlin/src/main/kotlin/Roman.kt
-        900 to "CM",
